# Firebase Configuration (Environment Variables)
#
# **SECURITY WARNING**: Do NOT commit .env files with real credentials to Git.
# This file is a template showing required variables.
#
# For local development:
# 1. Copy this file to .env (will be ignored by .gitignore)
# 2. Fill in your Firebase credentials from Firebase Console
# 3. flutter run will automatically load variables
#
# For GitHub Actions CI/CD:
# Set these as Repository Secrets in Settings > Secrets and variables > Actions
# Reference: https://docs.github.com/en/actions/security-guides/encrypted-secrets

